od/20260627-1/5547da12909f7395ff7df3e9e0073682.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "龚俊,钟楚曦,吴宣仪,高至霆,魏哲鸣,张晨光,温峥嵘,刘佩琦,萨日娜,高曙光,王姬,董璇,叶青,方芳", "director": "赵一龙", "content": "<p>自香港投行跳槽回内地投资公司发展的投资人徐斯（龚俊 饰），结识了国牌服装集团董事长独生女江湖（钟楚曦 饰），二人因商业理念不同而互不对盘。江湖父亲的企业突然破产，江湖一夜之间由云端跌落谷底。而一直颇有事业野心的徐斯对江湖父亲曾经一手打造的胶底鞋品牌“腾岳”势在必得，使得落魄的江湖决定不惜一切保住“腾岳”。经一番周旋较量，最终徐斯与江湖立下是否能够复兴“腾岳”的存亡生死契……</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202606/26/6gSQ97f8jZ97/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202310/30/syvVEkr5601/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202310/30/etHX0faVMY1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202310/30/UgRD9RfvAW1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202310/30/5KrCibBat71/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202310/31/maqQFU30ek1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202310/31/TmzXpUMqBw1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/01/RFpEm0a9aX1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/01/5BCTqnAMuX1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/02/9pqiCDfHMu1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/02/Lja7NwpUxx1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/03/7WXEdHn6K01/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/03/gMeCh1DuiM1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/04/nHLPXm59SW1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/04/uUvwktiaWC1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第15集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202311/05/pvKqL2BqSd1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": 